BT 1 0 0 1 56.69 398.89 Tm /F1 10.50 Tf (without a detector \("Detector unavailable. You can still capture."\). An explicit) Tj ET
BT 1 0 0 1 56.69 384.89 Tm /F1 10.50 Tf (`NLDetectorModels.prefetch\(context\)` ignores the policy, so call it when you do want) Tj ET
BT 1 0 0 1 56.69 370.89 Tm /F1 10.50 Tf (the cellular download \(for example when the rep opens the camera with no detector) Tj ET
BT 1 0 0 1 56.69 356.89 Tm /F1 10.50 Tf (yet\).) Tj ET
BT 1 0 0 1 56.69 336.89 Tm /F1 10.50 Tf (Allow `api.operations.neurolabs.ai` and `storage.googleapis.com` in any egress) Tj ET
BT 1 0 0 1 56.69 322.89 Tm /F1 10.50 Tf (allowlist. The detector reads its input size and class order from the model, and live) Tj ET
